      "writtenOn": "2025-05-06T14:46:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, KeyExchangeCurve25519SHA256 and KeyExchangeMLKEM768X25519SHA256 have a SHA256 suffix despite not having variants, while KeyExchangeECDHPNNN don\u0027t. We should pick one or the other.\n\nMaybe we remove all the SHA256 suffixes and only leave the SHA1 suffixes.\n\nIt\u0027s not like ML-KEM will ever be used with another hash.",
      "revId": "15f865b065f9c88e574e539c9cf4002846d8c8db",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705"
